# Cloudflare Workers / Pages _redirects — optional API edge proxy (mode 3).
#
# Do NOT add `/* /index.html 200` here. Workers rejects that rule as an
# infinite loop with default HTML handling. SPA fallback is configured in
# web/wrangler.toml via:
#   [assets] not_found_handling = "single-page-application"
#
# Mode 3 — edge proxy (same-origin). Replace API host, keep status 200,
# and place this file as web/public/_redirects before `vp build`:
/api/*  https://API_HOST_REPLACE_ME/api/:splat  200
/healthz  https://API_HOST_REPLACE_ME/healthz  200
#
# Mode 2 — CDN UI + cross-origin API: leave web/public/_redirects absent
# (SPA via wrangler.toml), set TM_CORS_ORIGINS, and use Server / VITE_API.
